              "value": "(auditory, concentrate)\n\nTrigger: The Hellbound attorney's turn begins\n\nThe attorney enumerates the alleged crimes of a creature they can see and attempts a Legal Lore check against that creature's Will DC. On a success, the attorney's Strikes deal an additional 2d6 precision damage (4d6 precision damage on a critical success) to the creature until the end of the attorney's turn."
